WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.890 --> 01:31.150
[My Journey to You]

01:31.160 --> 01:34.030
[Episode 20]

01:49.030 --> 01:49.539
Jin Fan.

02:06.660 --> 02:10.440
[Sacrifice the Important Ones. Forge the Unrivaled Saber.]

02:13.870 --> 02:15.200
Your kite really works.

02:15.270 --> 02:16.890
Didn't I tell you it can only be used in an emergency?

02:16.890 --> 02:17.710
Of course it's an emergency.

02:17.710 --> 02:19.100
Why else would I trouble you?

02:19.100 --> 02:21.070
If it weren't for you, I couldn't have come to the back hill.

02:21.070 --> 02:22.140
Don't let anyone know that

02:22.140 --> 02:23.740
-I brought you here.
-Got it.

02:24.160 --> 02:25.960
I can't go any further from here.

02:26.110 --> 02:26.710
Remember.

02:26.890 --> 02:28.070
The ancestral hall is on your right.

02:28.070 --> 02:29.650
The left is where Gong Ziyu is taking his trial.

02:29.650 --> 02:30.970
Don't take the wrong path

02:30.970 --> 02:31.850
and disturb the peace of our ancestors.

02:31.850 --> 02:32.860
Got it.

02:38.700 --> 02:40.550
Sacrifice the Important Ones.

02:41.930 --> 02:43.460
Forge the Unrivaled Saber.

03:02.710 --> 03:04.570
Who took the Heart Devouring Moon

03:05.090 --> 03:07.290
during Young Master Shangjue's trial?

03:08.390 --> 03:09.390
His subordinate.

03:10.230 --> 03:10.960
Was it Jin Fu?

03:11.580 --> 03:12.910
No, it was someone else.

03:21.940 --> 03:22.940
You're poisoned.

03:23.110 --> 03:24.040
Who did it to you?

03:25.260 --> 03:26.180
Lady Wuji.

03:27.079 --> 03:28.610
I've taken the Herb Elixir,

03:29.250 --> 03:31.470
but the poison hasn't been completely detoxified yet.

03:31.470 --> 03:32.400
I'll go find her.

03:32.610 --> 03:33.210
Elder Yue.

03:35.780 --> 03:36.980
She's not in her room.

03:37.570 --> 03:38.700
I've looked for her.

03:39.790 --> 03:40.720
The servant said

03:41.540 --> 03:44.140
she left with a bunch of joss paper and candles.

03:45.680 --> 03:46.610
Let me have a try.

03:48.720 --> 03:49.980
If I can't detoxify it,

03:50.130 --> 03:52.329
we'll have to ask someone else for help.

03:57.670 --> 03:58.700
Ziyu and Jin Fan

03:59.270 --> 04:01.470
have made it to the Hua Residence today.

04:04.190 --> 04:05.400
The ancestral hall is on the right.

04:05.400 --> 04:07.420
The left is where Gong Ziyu's taking the trial.

04:07.420 --> 04:08.350
I should go left.

04:09.140 --> 04:09.920
Careful.

04:10.380 --> 04:11.640
I don't have much time.

04:18.660 --> 04:19.190
Jin Fan.

04:25.090 --> 04:26.220
Lord Sword Wielder.

04:26.980 --> 04:27.910
If you're ready,

04:28.180 --> 04:29.380
we can start anytime.

04:31.250 --> 04:33.580
They're waiting for you at the front hill.

04:37.280 --> 04:37.970
I won't

04:39.400 --> 04:40.400
forge this saber.

04:45.340 --> 04:45.700
No.

04:46.670 --> 04:47.610
You have to.

04:49.970 --> 04:51.200
This is your mission.

04:57.380 --> 04:58.580
I have my mission too.

04:59.740 --> 05:00.740
This is your fate.

05:03.980 --> 05:05.050
Wake up, okay?

05:16.390 --> 05:16.880
What?

05:45.740 --> 05:47.550
I'm willing to sacrifice myself

05:48.620 --> 05:51.480
for you to forge the Unrivaled Sword, Young Master.

05:54.440 --> 05:55.680
But I'm not willing.

05:58.580 --> 05:59.760
You must be.

06:01.630 --> 06:02.830
Only by forging this saber

06:02.830 --> 06:04.060
can you become the Sword Wielder of the Gong family.

06:04.060 --> 06:05.110
Then tell me,

06:07.660 --> 06:09.550
why did the ancestors

06:10.350 --> 06:12.750
have to make us take this ridiculous trial?

06:17.010 --> 06:17.780
I don't know.

06:22.620 --> 06:25.150
But the ancestors must have their intentions

06:25.240 --> 06:26.650
making this rule.

06:29.740 --> 06:30.330
Maybe

06:30.910 --> 06:31.970
they believed that

06:32.830 --> 06:34.570
only those who are brutal and determined enough,

06:34.570 --> 06:35.659
both to themselves and to others,

06:35.659 --> 06:37.659
to achieve their goals

06:37.680 --> 06:40.280
are qualified to be leaders of the Gong family.

06:43.920 --> 06:45.250
I don't agree with that.

06:50.700 --> 06:52.360
I'll become the Sword Wielder

06:52.930 --> 06:53.860
in my own way,

06:55.560 --> 06:57.220
and lead the whole Gong family

06:59.050 --> 07:00.450
to take a different path.

07:24.950 --> 07:27.150
What's wrong? Are you chased by a ghost?

07:51.150 --> 07:52.700
Lady Wuji is dead.

07:53.270 --> 07:53.980
Save her.

07:54.490 --> 07:55.440
Save her!

07:56.700 --> 07:58.100
Lady Wuji is still alive.

08:09.590 --> 08:10.430
Lady Wuji!

08:11.110 --> 08:12.240
Lady Wuji!

08:15.980 --> 08:16.650
Young Master Hua.

08:16.650 --> 08:18.850
We found someone in the ancestral hall.

08:36.190 --> 08:36.850
Young Lord.

08:47.640 --> 08:50.940
[Yu]

10:40.230 --> 10:40.710
Look.

10:44.690 --> 10:45.820
Lord Sword Wielder.

10:48.050 --> 10:48.630
What?

11:13.610 --> 11:15.610
How dare you stop the Sword Wielder?

11:16.030 --> 11:17.330
Please forgive us, Young Master Ziyu.

11:17.330 --> 11:18.170
Elder told us that

11:18.170 --> 11:19.410
no one is allowed to enter.

11:19.410 --> 11:20.140
How dare you!

11:20.490 --> 11:22.540
How dare you call him Young Master Ziyu

11:22.540 --> 11:23.660
instead of Sword Wielder?

11:23.660 --> 11:25.520
You should be punished severely.

11:53.640 --> 11:54.290
Ziyu.

11:58.930 --> 11:59.460
Brother.

12:02.440 --> 12:02.970
Brother.

12:32.690 --> 12:33.450
Are you okay?

12:37.400 --> 12:39.390
My son found Huanyu in a secret room

12:40.320 --> 12:42.170
in the ancestral hall in Hua Residence.

12:42.170 --> 12:44.230
He had been imprisoned there.

12:45.740 --> 12:47.970
Huanyu had bruises all over his body,

12:48.490 --> 12:50.360
and was hungry and weak when he was found.

12:50.360 --> 12:51.220
He just woke up.

12:52.020 --> 12:52.690
And

12:53.600 --> 12:55.210
the person who imprisoned him

12:55.210 --> 12:57.810
took all his martial arts skills away from him.

13:04.330 --> 13:04.860
Brother.

13:06.030 --> 13:06.900
Who on earth

13:07.510 --> 13:08.750
did this to you?

13:10.680 --> 13:11.680
It was Anonymous.

13:13.810 --> 13:14.470
Anonymous.

13:16.940 --> 13:18.400
Why is it Anonymous again?

13:19.500 --> 13:20.960
Who on earth is Anonymous?

13:22.590 --> 13:23.680
It's Lady Wuji.

13:30.110 --> 13:32.110
Young Lord identified her himself.

13:32.170 --> 13:33.170
It can't be wrong.

13:34.650 --> 13:36.510
Don't call me Young Lord anymore.

13:37.570 --> 13:40.030
My younger brother is the Sword Wielder now.

13:42.070 --> 13:42.510
Ziyu.

13:43.350 --> 13:44.400
Before you came,

13:44.670 --> 13:45.170
Huanyu

13:45.620 --> 13:46.880
has told us

13:47.440 --> 13:49.300
the ins and outs of what happened.

13:50.600 --> 13:51.270
Wuji

13:51.540 --> 13:54.800
and the spy from Wufeng who pretended to be Miss Zheng Nanyi

13:55.030 --> 13:56.230
worked in collusion.

13:56.900 --> 13:58.960
They killed the former Sword Wielder

13:59.040 --> 14:00.370
and imprisoned Huanyu.

14:01.960 --> 14:02.970
At that time,

14:03.430 --> 14:05.090
when we saw the body of Huanyu,

14:05.260 --> 14:07.790
it was just smoke and mirrors created by Wuji.

14:12.210 --> 14:13.940
She took my martial arts skills

14:14.460 --> 14:15.950
and locked me up.

14:17.530 --> 14:19.170
After that, every once in a while,

14:19.170 --> 14:20.660
she'd use the excuse of burning incense for my father

14:20.660 --> 14:22.320
to come to the ancestral hall.

14:22.510 --> 14:23.640
Every time she came,

14:24.040 --> 14:26.240
she'd leave after leaving me some food.

14:27.630 --> 14:28.030
But...

14:29.270 --> 14:30.070
But why

14:30.870 --> 14:32.200
would Lady Wuji do that?

14:32.700 --> 14:33.390
Yes.

14:34.110 --> 14:35.510
Why didn't Wuji kill you?

14:36.040 --> 14:37.740
Why did she go through so much trouble

14:37.740 --> 14:38.670
to imprison you?

14:46.940 --> 14:47.850
What she wants

14:48.240 --> 14:50.770
is that thing in the Hua Residence, of course.

14:55.110 --> 14:55.810
What is it?

14:59.800 --> 15:01.530
Then why did she kill Elder Yue?

15:02.910 --> 15:04.910
She couldn't get the answer from me,

15:05.890 --> 15:07.290
so she threatened me that

15:08.310 --> 15:09.230
if I didn't tell her,

15:09.230 --> 15:11.430
she'd kill everyone in the Gong family.

15:12.830 --> 15:14.690
I know how powerful that would be,

15:15.030 --> 15:16.140
so I didn't budge.

15:18.920 --> 15:20.780
It was me who got Elder Yue killed.

15:23.220 --> 15:23.900
Young Lord.

15:24.150 --> 15:26.080
Don't take it too hard on yourself.

15:26.190 --> 15:26.860
Wufeng

15:27.220 --> 15:28.620
has always been vicious.

15:29.630 --> 15:30.490
However,

15:31.020 --> 15:32.720
if Wuji is Anonymous,

15:33.620 --> 15:35.120
then who

15:35.430 --> 15:37.360
could be the one that attacked her?

15:38.230 --> 15:39.530
She was attacked?

15:41.500 --> 15:42.360
No matter what,

15:42.620 --> 15:43.900
it's a good thing for the Gong family

15:43.900 --> 15:45.520
that Anonymous is gone.

15:46.860 --> 15:48.940
But we can't help but wonder

15:49.780 --> 15:51.170
who did it.

15:51.610 --> 15:52.760
Could it be someone that

15:52.760 --> 15:55.100
had suspected the identity of Wuji for long,

15:55.100 --> 15:56.900
but couldn't find any evidence?

15:57.570 --> 16:00.300
So that person decided to kill her no matter what,

16:01.150 --> 16:02.750
to prevent future troubles.

16:07.150 --> 16:08.540
I was seriously injured and have been bedridden.

16:08.540 --> 16:10.030
I can't even protect myself.

16:10.030 --> 16:12.220
Elder Xue, there's no need to suspect me.

16:12.220 --> 16:14.080
The person who assassinated Wuji

16:14.380 --> 16:15.580
doesn't dare to admit it

16:15.580 --> 16:16.760
after that.

16:17.430 --> 16:19.430
It must be someone else from Wufeng.

16:20.660 --> 16:24.010
How could there be so many people from Wufeng in the Gong Residence?

16:24.010 --> 16:24.450
Yes.

16:25.870 --> 16:29.130
It must be another spy who sneaked into the Gong Residence.

16:29.740 --> 16:31.670
Maybe they disagreed on something

16:32.110 --> 16:33.690
and got into internal conflict.

16:33.690 --> 16:34.530
Or maybe

16:35.140 --> 16:37.870
Wuji's existence became a threat to that person.

16:38.140 --> 16:40.010
So that person decided to kill her to silence her.

16:40.010 --> 16:41.670
Why don't we just ask Lady Wuji

16:42.010 --> 16:43.420
who attacked her?

16:47.180 --> 16:48.240
Where is Lady Wuji?

16:48.840 --> 16:49.720
Is she okay?

16:51.090 --> 16:52.820
Lady Wuji is severely injured.

16:53.100 --> 16:54.740
The murderer crushed her throat

16:54.740 --> 16:56.140
and injured her trachea.

16:56.270 --> 16:57.870
Although her life was saved,

16:59.360 --> 17:00.760
she's barely holding on.

17:04.530 --> 17:05.619
Report. Sword Wielder.

17:05.619 --> 17:06.230
Elder.

17:06.589 --> 17:07.430
Young Master.

17:07.980 --> 17:09.579
Lady Wuji's life is at stake,

17:09.760 --> 17:12.619
but she still struggled and wrote these words down.

17:29.360 --> 17:30.710
I dare not make a decision,

17:30.710 --> 17:32.240
so I came to report it to you.

17:42.200 --> 17:43.400
They all say "Sword".

17:44.450 --> 17:46.450
It seems that even when she's dying,

17:46.780 --> 17:50.780
she's still thinking about how nice the former Sword Wielder was to her.

17:51.780 --> 17:54.090
I think she must feel guilty.

18:00.020 --> 18:02.050
Did she say who assassinated her?

18:02.690 --> 18:03.130
Yes.

18:04.320 --> 18:05.000
But

18:06.260 --> 18:07.790
I'm not sure what she meant.

18:09.110 --> 18:10.040
What do you mean?

18:10.250 --> 18:11.740
She kept repeating a word.

18:13.500 --> 18:14.910
Xu... Xu...

18:18.270 --> 18:18.740
Xu?

18:19.720 --> 18:20.750
What could it be?

18:20.790 --> 18:21.190
Yun.

18:23.900 --> 18:24.660
It's Yun.

18:30.290 --> 18:31.930
But there's no one surnamed Yun

18:31.930 --> 18:33.320
in the Gong family.

20:01.140 --> 20:01.790
My Lady.

20:04.500 --> 20:05.630
I've come to see you.

20:24.750 --> 20:25.750
When I was little,

20:28.280 --> 20:30.010
you took care of me day and night

20:31.300 --> 20:33.030
every time I got sick.

20:35.630 --> 20:37.760
Every time I quarreled with my father,

20:39.270 --> 20:41.270
you managed to make both of us happy.

20:43.910 --> 20:45.000
On my birthdays,

20:46.850 --> 20:48.710
you'd make me longevity noodles.

20:52.590 --> 20:53.590
In winter,

20:55.380 --> 20:57.110
you know I can't stand the cold,

20:58.910 --> 21:01.170
so you used to make me sugar-coated haws.

21:03.450 --> 21:04.780
I could only be so at ease

21:06.680 --> 21:08.210
because you were by my side.

21:11.640 --> 21:12.250
My Lady.

21:15.380 --> 21:16.220
In my heart,

21:18.950 --> 21:21.150
I've already regarded you as my mother.

21:26.850 --> 21:27.820
But now,

21:30.210 --> 21:32.940
I realized that I've never seen your true colors.

21:42.670 --> 21:44.270
Gong Shangjue always told me

21:44.920 --> 21:46.250
that you are Anonymous,

21:46.620 --> 21:48.020
but I never believed him.

21:49.980 --> 21:51.790
But now, even my brother Huanyu

21:51.810 --> 21:53.140
said you're Anonymous.

21:53.260 --> 21:53.580
I...

21:58.950 --> 22:00.080
I have to believe it.

22:05.190 --> 22:08.320
Men, unlike grass or trees, have feelings and emotions.

22:08.790 --> 22:11.460
I'll keep your kindness in my heart.

22:15.300 --> 22:16.710
But you killed my father

22:17.480 --> 22:18.940
and hurt my older brother.

22:19.460 --> 22:21.010
They are my closest family.

22:21.850 --> 22:22.980
I can't forgive you.

22:23.300 --> 22:23.910
My Lady.

22:51.620 --> 22:52.080
Mother!

23:14.570 --> 23:16.970
Elder Yue led a team to search the back hill.

23:17.170 --> 23:19.430
He found the weapon that killed Elder Yue

23:19.840 --> 23:22.970
behind the memorial tablet of the former Sword Wielder.

23:29.340 --> 23:31.270
They were here on the Elder's order

23:32.970 --> 23:34.370
to execute Her Ladyship.

24:41.920 --> 24:42.660
To be honest,

24:43.540 --> 24:44.840
I haven't had sugar-coated haws

24:44.840 --> 24:46.750
made by you for a long time, My Lady.

24:46.750 --> 24:48.210
I'll prepare some for you.

24:48.690 --> 24:50.690
You can have them when you come back.

25:04.030 --> 25:05.200
Thank you

25:06.150 --> 25:08.150
for defending me this time, My Lady.

25:08.370 --> 25:09.570
I'm really grateful.

25:10.600 --> 25:12.930
Although you are not my biological child,

25:14.950 --> 25:17.150
I've always treated you as my own child.

26:32.370 --> 26:34.780
♫The memories you saw in your dream♫

26:34.390 --> 26:35.690
As thin as cicada wings.

26:35.690 --> 26:36.780
Sharp enough to cut through paper and hair.

26:35.710 --> 26:36.800
♫Shone bright♫

26:37.660 --> 26:38.590
It's my wish to

26:37.660 --> 26:38.710
♫In the rain♫

26:38.970 --> 26:40.120
have a sword forged by you.

26:40.120 --> 26:42.750
♫I set time into a chess game♫

26:40.900 --> 26:43.610
My wife died because of a sword I forged.

26:43.570 --> 26:45.670
♫Waiting for you♫

26:44.360 --> 26:46.560
I've sworn not to forge swords anymore.

26:47.810 --> 26:48.690
Please go back.

26:47.850 --> 26:50.630
♫Every encounter is good luck♫

26:51.760 --> 26:54.390
♫Every farewell is a regret♫

26:55.310 --> 26:56.030
News came that

26:55.600 --> 27:00.500
♫Fate is waiting to be written by the blade♫

26:56.800 --> 26:58.730
Gong Hongyu showed up in Jiangnan.

26:59.260 --> 26:59.950
This time,

27:00.180 --> 27:01.710
you'll be leading the team.

27:03.320 --> 27:06.090
♫The traces you left in the dream♫

27:06.800 --> 27:07.900
♫It's like a riddle♫

27:06.890 --> 27:07.820
I won't kill you,

27:08.670 --> 27:09.830
♫There's no answer♫

27:08.920 --> 27:11.050
but you must forget what you saw today.

27:11.070 --> 27:13.670
♫I sewed winter clothes with memories♫

27:14.490 --> 27:15.710
♫Every needle♫

27:15.630 --> 27:16.490
Miss.

27:15.960 --> 27:17.960
♫Reminds me of you♫

27:16.990 --> 27:17.790
What's wrong?

27:18.860 --> 27:21.760
♫Suddenly I forget the world♫

27:22.690 --> 27:23.650
Thank you.

27:22.710 --> 27:25.610
♫I hold your hand and worry about your lack of clothing♫

27:24.600 --> 27:25.860
How should I thank you?

27:26.510 --> 27:32.850
♫Without regret, the fallen do not give up on the world♫

27:27.030 --> 27:28.110
If you don't mind that

27:28.110 --> 27:30.100
I'm older than you,

27:30.310 --> 27:32.620
can I come with you

27:32.870 --> 27:33.690
and be your family?

27:33.040 --> 27:35.860
♫I cross mountains and rivers to run towards you♫

27:33.720 --> 27:34.370
Miss.

27:36.190 --> 27:37.790
♫To find you♫

27:38.210 --> 27:40.610
♫And embrace your heart♫

27:40.900 --> 27:43.270
♫I don't care about their reminder♫

27:44.010 --> 27:47.750
♫I grip tightly to the blade♫

27:45.310 --> 27:45.820
Ziyu.

27:47.120 --> 27:48.070
Are you okay?

27:48.530 --> 27:51.380
♫Let this sharp blade be the brush♫

27:51.720 --> 27:53.420
♫To carve in my heart♫

27:53.670 --> 27:56.240
♫You and me♫

27:56.510 --> 28:03.280
♫A world only for us♫

28:00.780 --> 28:01.180
Mei.

28:02.860 --> 28:03.660
I sent someone

28:03.860 --> 28:05.230
to investigate your background.

28:05.230 --> 28:06.070
Father!

28:07.100 --> 28:08.360
Your father Ming Xiong

28:08.510 --> 28:11.370
was once the best sword forger in the martial world.

28:11.660 --> 28:13.650
Wufeng wanted him to work for them,

28:14.600 --> 28:16.460
but your father turned them down.

28:20.480 --> 28:20.940
So,

28:21.340 --> 28:22.670
Wufeng got so angry that

28:23.510 --> 28:25.990
they kidnapped your father and imprisoned him.

28:25.990 --> 28:27.060
And Wufeng threatened them

28:27.060 --> 28:27.860
with your life

28:28.650 --> 28:30.180
to forge swords for Wufeng.

28:32.270 --> 28:35.100
♫The traces you left in the dream♫

28:35.550 --> 28:36.870
♫It's like a riddle♫

28:37.630 --> 28:38.760
♫There's no answer♫

28:39.960 --> 28:42.580
♫In the wind in the wilderness at twilight♫

28:41.240 --> 28:41.830
Father.

28:42.730 --> 28:43.470
You thought

28:43.230 --> 28:46.470
♫I think of you, and I hear you♫

28:43.950 --> 28:46.680
you were abandoned by your father and younger brother.

28:46.680 --> 28:48.210
You've really left me.

28:47.790 --> 28:50.860
♫My hair grows grey and my dream is gone♫

28:48.630 --> 28:50.290
But what you don't know is that

28:50.670 --> 28:51.980
the real culprit

28:51.640 --> 28:54.730
♫I can draw the wind and rain but not you♫

28:52.140 --> 28:53.150
is Wufeng.

28:53.700 --> 28:54.470
It was Wufeng

28:54.980 --> 28:55.860
who kidnapped them.

28:55.630 --> 29:01.680
♫Forgetting about love and death, love and hatred♫

28:56.620 --> 28:58.280
You were blinded by Wufeng.

28:59.100 --> 29:00.030
You are not evil.

29:00.950 --> 29:03.150
I know how kind you've been

29:02.210 --> 29:04.790
♫I cross mountains and rivers to run towards you♫

29:03.550 --> 29:04.640
to Lan'er and Ziyu.

29:05.190 --> 29:06.910
♫To find you♫

29:05.820 --> 29:08.360
I'm willing to give you a chance to choose again.

29:07.140 --> 29:09.710
♫And embrace your heart♫

29:09.920 --> 29:12.500
♫I don't care about their reminder♫

29:12.670 --> 29:16.580
♫I grip tightly to the blade♫

29:14.830 --> 29:15.570
Not long ago,

29:15.860 --> 29:17.350
I sent a message to Wufeng

29:17.420 --> 29:20.380
♫Winning or losing isn't important in this game♫

29:17.940 --> 29:20.670
and revealed the time of the next marriage selection.

29:20.670 --> 29:21.770
Do you need me

29:20.740 --> 29:22.500
♫The black and white pieces♫

29:21.950 --> 29:23.150
to get their plan out of them?

29:22.730 --> 29:25.380
♫Leave traces on the board♫

29:24.390 --> 29:25.990
Since you chose the Gong family,

29:25.550 --> 29:32.230
♫They create a small world♫

29:26.560 --> 29:27.560
you are my family.

29:28.050 --> 29:28.610
Here,

29:29.180 --> 29:31.110
you don't have to bear any burden.

29:31.740 --> 29:32.330
Just

29:32.400 --> 29:34.120
live a simple life.

29:32.900 --> 29:35.570
I'll try my best to run towards you...

29:35.990 --> 29:36.750
Hurry up.

29:36.090 --> 29:40.440
♫I hug you and call out your name♫

29:37.330 --> 29:39.100
Young Lord's wedding is tonight.

29:39.100 --> 29:40.250
Chop-chop.

29:40.740 --> 29:43.530
♫Tearing apart all the storms in this world♫

29:43.970 --> 29:48.130
♫Cutting off fate♫

29:46.930 --> 29:47.800
Year of Bingwu.

29:48.450 --> 29:51.180
♫Our story has tenderness♫

29:49.310 --> 29:50.910
This is a newly forged sword.

29:51.640 --> 29:53.300
♫It has regrets♫

29:52.040 --> 29:52.820
Can my father

29:53.550 --> 29:56.260
♫But it has no ending♫

29:53.990 --> 29:55.520
and brother still be alive?

29:56.560 --> 30:03.050
♫A cloud and a feather together in my palm♫

29:56.870 --> 29:57.990
Don't cry, Sister.

29:58.780 --> 29:59.750
When I grow up,

30:00.150 --> 30:01.700
I'll forge the best sword

30:01.830 --> 30:03.230
and protect you forever.

30:04.100 --> 30:06.350
♫I run towards you with all my might♫

30:07.060 --> 30:11.260
♫I hug you and call out your name♫

30:11.680 --> 30:14.290
♫Tearing apart all the storms in this world♫

30:14.830 --> 30:18.930
♫Cutting off fate♫

30:17.210 --> 30:20.170
[Gong Hongyu lied. Your father and younger brother are still alive. This dagger is the proof.]

30:17.210 --> 30:20.170
[If you want to save them, do as I say. Find Infinite Heat.]

30:19.350 --> 30:22.120
♫Our story has tenderness♫

30:22.360 --> 30:24.200
♫It has regrets♫

30:24.520 --> 30:27.250
♫But it has no ending♫

30:27.380 --> 30:34.860
♫A cloud and a feather together in my palm♫

31:47.950 --> 31:49.010
It's getting cold.

31:50.620 --> 31:52.220
Go back to your room and rest.

31:55.870 --> 31:59.330
I thought I could never see you again.

32:13.100 --> 32:15.100
I sneaked to the Hua Residence today

32:16.500 --> 32:18.830
because I was afraid you'd be sacrificed.

32:19.380 --> 32:22.510
I didn't expect that I would find out Lady Wuji's secret.

32:26.250 --> 32:27.250
When I was little,

32:27.700 --> 32:29.760
every time I went to the Yu Residence,

32:30.110 --> 32:32.910
Her Ladyship would give me a lot of delicious food.

32:34.040 --> 32:36.170
She treated me and Gong Ziyu very well.

32:39.460 --> 32:40.390
Could all of this

32:43.430 --> 32:44.900
be fake?

33:30.700 --> 33:32.430
Don't be too sad, Young Master.

33:33.920 --> 33:35.580
For Lady Wuji,

33:36.960 --> 33:37.680
her death

33:38.710 --> 33:39.640
was punishment,

33:41.960 --> 33:43.690
but it was also a kind of relief.

33:49.740 --> 33:50.620
What exactly

33:53.100 --> 33:54.860
is Wufeng like?

33:58.520 --> 33:59.570
And what are

34:01.730 --> 34:03.100
those from Wufeng like?

34:07.780 --> 34:10.179
Those from Wufeng Sect are cold and brutal.

34:11.380 --> 34:12.949
They are merciless and heartless.

34:12.949 --> 34:14.409
The biggest taboo for a spy

34:14.469 --> 34:15.389
is love.

34:15.870 --> 34:17.730
Because love brings weaknesses,

34:18.650 --> 34:19.870
which brings fear.

34:22.320 --> 34:24.260
Wufeng doesn't allow us to have fear.

34:24.260 --> 34:25.590
As long as you're alive,

34:26.210 --> 34:27.810
you must be useful to Wufeng.

34:28.460 --> 34:31.389
Even if you die, you still have to be useful to Wufeng.

34:31.860 --> 34:32.949
We can only

34:34.000 --> 34:35.530
have missions in our minds,

34:36.590 --> 34:37.679
and nothing else.

34:39.889 --> 34:41.080
Not even ourselves.

34:46.969 --> 34:48.250
Can you feel any pain?

34:52.830 --> 34:53.330
Yes.

34:58.020 --> 34:59.030
But I'm used to it.

35:06.170 --> 35:07.410
Do you know why

35:08.480 --> 35:10.680
I envy that the Gong family uses sabers,

35:11.510 --> 35:12.970
while Wufeng uses swords?

35:14.550 --> 35:15.230
Why?

35:16.440 --> 35:18.300
Because a saber is single-edged.

35:19.150 --> 35:21.750
It protects you when doing damage to the enemy.

35:23.020 --> 35:24.950
However, a sword is double-edged.

35:25.180 --> 35:26.580
It hurts yourself as well

35:27.160 --> 35:28.360
when hurting others.

35:35.830 --> 35:37.690
You are one of the Gong family now.

35:38.310 --> 35:40.840
I'll teach you how to use a saber in the future.

35:42.200 --> 35:44.530
You can't stay in the Gong family anymore.

35:45.600 --> 35:46.230
I know.

35:46.780 --> 35:47.810
I will leave.

35:53.270 --> 35:54.360
Do you have fear

36:00.790 --> 36:01.890
in your heart?

36:08.230 --> 36:09.700
I know you want to ask

36:12.310 --> 36:13.840
if there's love in my heart.

36:22.810 --> 36:24.140
I asked you if you like me

36:25.540 --> 36:27.200
when you took the truth grass.

36:28.480 --> 36:30.380
You said no.

36:39.870 --> 36:40.670
What is this?

36:42.690 --> 36:44.950
This is the truth grass made by Elder Yue.

36:45.460 --> 36:46.490
This is not fake.

36:47.500 --> 36:48.270
Take one.

36:48.990 --> 36:50.100
I'll ask you again.

37:00.920 --> 37:02.320
You're lying to me again.

37:03.480 --> 37:05.610
This is just a piece of licorice candy.

37:09.120 --> 37:10.400
So, do you like me?

37:38.860 --> 37:43.090
♫The mountains become sand with the wind♫

37:46.260 --> 37:50.460
♫The river takes me home♫

37:52.860 --> 37:54.320
Why did you steal my candy?

37:55.690 --> 37:58.700
♫The cloud in the sky doesn't speak♫

37:56.110 --> 37:57.420
Because it's my turn.

37:59.240 --> 38:02.600
♫Where are you, where are you?♫

38:00.690 --> 38:02.690
Now that I've taken the truth grass,

38:02.790 --> 38:05.460
♫How are you?♫

38:03.260 --> 38:05.190
it's your turn to ask me a question.

38:10.060 --> 38:11.220
You already know

38:13.450 --> 38:14.790
that I'm from Wufeng.

38:18.700 --> 38:20.430
Will you really not despise me,

38:22.590 --> 38:24.850
and resolutely stand by my side forever?

38:31.260 --> 38:33.320
I will resolutely stand by your side.

38:36.090 --> 38:37.290
No matter in the past,

38:39.270 --> 38:39.930
at present,

38:41.330 --> 38:42.310
or in the future.

38:43.530 --> 38:44.390
My choice

38:46.280 --> 38:47.140
is always you.

38:59.900 --> 39:01.300
This is not truth grass.

39:04.370 --> 39:05.040
I know.

39:06.510 --> 39:07.150
But...

39:08.470 --> 39:09.670
This is the vow grass.

39:12.550 --> 39:13.450
Vow.

39:15.130 --> 39:16.620
So what I just said

39:17.460 --> 39:18.600
is my vow.

39:23.200 --> 39:24.200
I'll keep my word

39:27.060 --> 39:28.090
for all eternity.

39:35.660 --> 39:36.160
Look.

39:36.830 --> 39:38.430
Your hands are already warm.

39:39.500 --> 39:40.840
I told you that

39:42.550 --> 39:43.680
I could warm them up.

39:44.900 --> 39:45.830
Do you remember?

39:49.480 --> 39:50.630
The elders say that

39:51.390 --> 39:53.370
our hands are connected to our heart.

39:53.370 --> 39:54.770
Those who have warm hands

39:55.110 --> 39:56.770
are naturally warm-hearted.

39:58.130 --> 40:00.360
Young Master Ziyu, you look cold, but you're warm-hearted.

40:00.360 --> 40:01.350
I can feel that.

40:02.190 --> 40:03.390
But I'm the opposite.

40:04.310 --> 40:05.340
I'm actually

40:05.850 --> 40:07.780
envious of you, Young Master Ziyu.

40:08.450 --> 40:09.380
I can warm you up.

40:59.630 --> 41:00.630
Brother Yuanzhi.

41:04.060 --> 41:05.120
Where are you going

41:07.150 --> 41:08.030
in such a hurry?

41:10.890 --> 41:12.570
Chuyun Chonglian has bloomed.

41:12.570 --> 41:14.670
I cultivated three new ones for us.

41:15.260 --> 41:16.320
One for my brother.

41:16.420 --> 41:17.360
One for myself.

41:22.110 --> 41:22.800
Then...

41:23.370 --> 41:24.770
What about the third one?

41:26.140 --> 41:27.820
Miss Shangguan, you are too courteous.

41:27.820 --> 41:29.380
You've moved to the Jue Residence for so long.

41:29.380 --> 41:30.790
We've become family.

41:31.370 --> 41:32.830
So of course, the third one

41:33.730 --> 41:35.790
is for Young Master Yue for research.

41:39.250 --> 41:39.800
What?

41:40.300 --> 41:41.300
You want one, too?

41:42.740 --> 41:44.920
Chuyun Chonglian is truly precious.

41:45.640 --> 41:47.040
It's attractive indeed.

41:47.910 --> 41:50.170
But I advise you not to have designs on it.

41:51.160 --> 41:53.490
If you have any improper thoughts about it

41:53.620 --> 41:54.820
and upset my brother,

41:55.070 --> 41:56.670
even deities can't save you.

41:59.500 --> 42:01.230
I don't need deities to save me.

42:01.960 --> 42:03.450
No matter what happens,

42:04.110 --> 42:04.950
your brother

42:05.490 --> 42:07.150
won't be willing to let me die.

42:07.740 --> 42:08.940
Don't you believe it?

42:10.010 --> 42:11.010
It's not dawn yet.

42:11.170 --> 42:12.550
Do you want to go back to sleep?

42:12.550 --> 42:14.080
So you can keep on dreaming.

42:14.510 --> 42:15.140
Do you

42:15.390 --> 42:16.390
want to take a bet?

42:16.400 --> 42:17.320
Go find Gong Ziyu

42:17.320 --> 42:18.080
at Wanhua Pavilion.

42:18.080 --> 42:19.140
He likes gambling.

42:19.690 --> 42:20.290
By the way,

42:22.850 --> 42:23.540
thank you.

42:24.740 --> 42:25.370
Thank me?

42:27.070 --> 42:29.020
The mattress you gifted your brother,

42:29.020 --> 42:31.650
which is made of the jade seal and ink bamboo,

42:32.300 --> 42:34.030
is really warm and nourishing.

42:34.420 --> 42:35.260
No wonder

42:36.060 --> 42:36.990
Young Master Shangjue said

42:36.990 --> 42:39.050
I've been looking better these days.

42:45.240 --> 42:46.300
What's that smell?

42:47.490 --> 42:47.930
Oh.

42:48.920 --> 42:50.120
It's the smell of tea.

43:06.190 --> 43:06.880
Sister.

43:07.390 --> 43:08.450
I'm here to see you.

43:13.370 --> 43:14.110
See me?

43:17.410 --> 43:18.770
See if I'm dead?

43:20.470 --> 43:21.730
You're funny, Sister.

43:22.950 --> 43:24.450
Everyone knows that

43:24.870 --> 43:28.020
all the three lineages in the back hill, Xue, Yue, and Hua,

43:28.020 --> 43:29.150
are backing you up.

43:30.430 --> 43:32.740
I thought your identity

43:32.850 --> 43:35.110
would definitely be revealed this time.

43:35.430 --> 43:39.070
I didn't expect that Gong Ziyu would defend you like that.

43:40.850 --> 43:42.200
Sister, you're good.

43:45.690 --> 43:47.150
You didn't just sneak here

43:48.710 --> 43:50.730
to praise me, right?

43:52.300 --> 43:53.290
What do you want?

43:55.290 --> 43:57.690
I want a way to get out of the Gong Residence.

43:59.030 --> 44:01.530
You are imprisoned in the Yu Residence

44:01.570 --> 44:03.170
under strict surveillance.

44:03.860 --> 44:04.920
Between you and me,

44:05.540 --> 44:08.140
one of us has to send the message out, right?

44:11.090 --> 44:11.760
After all,

44:13.000 --> 44:14.600
it's about to be half a month.

44:19.950 --> 44:20.550
By the way,

44:21.610 --> 44:24.010
I suddenly thought of the Fortnight Flies.

44:24.300 --> 44:25.140
I was thinking

44:25.790 --> 44:28.720
maybe I should reveal this secret to the whole world.

44:28.780 --> 44:29.710
This way, Wufeng

44:29.950 --> 44:31.800
can no longer let you work for it.

44:34.890 --> 44:36.020
The Fortnight Flies

44:36.340 --> 44:39.260
are just one of Wufeng's means to threaten the martial world.

44:39.260 --> 44:40.790
The real leverage of Wufeng

44:41.300 --> 44:42.080
is secrets.

44:42.940 --> 44:43.500
Secrets?

44:44.930 --> 44:46.930
Wufeng has the secrets of all sects,

44:47.810 --> 44:49.610
and it threatens them with them.

44:54.280 --> 44:55.880
Then, let's stay put for now.

44:56.910 --> 44:58.060
We'll get them all

44:58.380 --> 44:59.640
when the time is right.

45:01.420 --> 45:02.950
What about Shangguan Qian?

45:03.210 --> 45:04.340
Should we tell her?

45:05.900 --> 45:07.500
Shangguan Qian is scheming.

45:07.790 --> 45:09.920
She's hard to read and unpredictable.

45:10.350 --> 45:11.550
It's not the time yet.

45:14.970 --> 45:17.390
This is the secret passageway to exit the Gong Residence.

45:17.390 --> 45:18.720
It also marks

45:19.180 --> 45:22.310
the location of the mechanisms and how to shut them down.

45:36.110 --> 45:37.620
You must have taken it down

45:37.900 --> 45:39.850
last Lantern Festival

45:39.930 --> 45:41.990
when Gong Ziyu took you down the hill.

45:46.470 --> 45:47.530
Thank you, Sister.

45:48.130 --> 45:50.260
I will bring the antidote back for you.

45:53.950 --> 45:54.680
Where is Yun?

45:54.980 --> 45:56.510
I haven't seen her for days.

45:57.730 --> 46:00.250
Eldest Young Miss has come to Yu Residence a lot to hang out with her these days.

46:00.250 --> 46:02.780
They've been spending a lot of time together.

46:03.150 --> 46:05.480
What is Gong Zishang up to?

46:06.070 --> 46:07.000
Discipline her.

46:09.160 --> 46:09.580
I...

46:11.620 --> 46:12.420
What's wrong?

46:14.430 --> 46:15.100
Nothing.

46:16.830 --> 46:19.030
There's something I don't understand.

46:20.270 --> 46:20.800
Go ahead.

46:21.340 --> 46:22.460
Anonymous is dead.

46:23.150 --> 46:25.170
We've also successfully rescued Young Lord Huanyu...

46:25.170 --> 46:26.180
I mean, the former Young Lord,

46:26.180 --> 46:28.000
from the back hill.

46:28.590 --> 46:30.120
It has come to an end for now.

46:30.960 --> 46:33.360
But why hasn't anyone held us accountable

46:33.420 --> 46:35.860
for blowing up the prison and saving Yun Weishan?

46:35.860 --> 46:36.910
Perhaps it's inappropriate for the Elders

46:36.910 --> 46:39.240
to make this proposal

46:39.350 --> 46:40.820
since their descendants were involved in this activity.

46:40.820 --> 46:43.620
But why hasn't Gong Shangjue brought it up either?

46:44.370 --> 46:46.580
It's like this never happened.

46:48.680 --> 46:50.480
Given his personality in the past,

46:50.480 --> 46:52.610
he should have made a big fuss out of this.

46:52.610 --> 46:53.420
I think

46:54.310 --> 46:56.110
he must be up to something.

47:17.020 --> 47:18.150
I found Anonymous.

47:18.820 --> 47:19.880
Wuji is Anonymous.

47:20.840 --> 47:22.100
You want the antidote.

47:22.160 --> 47:24.760
This little information isn't enough, right?

47:33.760 --> 47:35.780
What about Gong Shangjue's weakness?

47:35.780 --> 47:37.040
Isn't Gong Shangjue's weakness

47:37.040 --> 47:38.340
Gong Yuanzhi?

47:39.960 --> 47:41.220
Besides Gong Yuanzhi,

47:41.910 --> 47:43.310
there's a fatal weakness

47:43.850 --> 47:45.110
in his body.

47:47.440 --> 47:49.160
Every half a month,

47:49.960 --> 47:51.390
there're four hours

47:52.380 --> 47:55.440
when Gong Shangjue has absolutely no internal skills.

48:05.300 --> 48:07.630
Is it enough in exchange for the antidote?

48:12.920 --> 48:14.270
From 1 p.m. to 5 p.m.

48:24.940 --> 48:25.650
Also,

48:27.080 --> 48:29.410
the place where Infinite Heat is hidden in

48:29.580 --> 48:31.980
is the Underground Palace in the back hill.

48:32.550 --> 48:35.550
The Infinite Heat is the top secret of the Gong family.

48:35.590 --> 48:37.250
You even managed to know that?

48:38.510 --> 48:41.100
Of course, I went through a lot of trouble for that.

48:41.100 --> 48:42.900
I've sacrificed a lot this time.

48:43.870 --> 48:45.210
Let's have a talk

48:46.290 --> 48:47.550
after it's done.

48:48.340 --> 48:49.210
I feel

48:49.790 --> 48:51.450
you're more like my superior.

49:01.330 --> 49:02.660
Brother, what's wrong?

49:03.640 --> 49:04.420
I'm okay.

49:04.840 --> 49:07.110
I stayed in the secret room for too long,

49:07.670 --> 49:09.400
so I'm not used to strong light.

49:10.150 --> 49:13.470
It occurred to me that there's a cellar for wine storing here.

49:13.470 --> 49:14.730
There's no light,

49:15.870 --> 49:17.990
so it's suitable for me to recuperate.

49:17.990 --> 49:19.920
So I asked them to carry me here.

49:20.320 --> 49:21.850
I plan to clean this place up

49:21.920 --> 49:22.840
and move here.

49:23.740 --> 49:25.340
How can you live in the cellar?

49:25.340 --> 49:28.260
Ziyu, you're kind and reasonable.

49:28.300 --> 49:29.400
I understand.

49:30.150 --> 49:30.870
Besides,

49:31.310 --> 49:33.240
you're already the Sword Wielder.

49:36.060 --> 49:36.640
Brother.

49:38.180 --> 49:40.040
The position of the Sword Wielder

49:41.710 --> 49:42.970
should be yours.

49:47.190 --> 49:48.470
When you get better,

49:49.310 --> 49:51.350
I'll return this position to you.

49:55.010 --> 49:57.170
What nonsense are you talking about?

49:59.590 --> 50:00.700
We are brothers.

50:01.200 --> 50:02.400
What's mine is yours.

50:02.610 --> 50:03.430
There's no

50:03.940 --> 50:05.940
borrowing or returning between us.

50:06.420 --> 50:07.420
It doesn't matter

50:07.950 --> 50:09.750
which of us is the Sword Wielder.

50:09.990 --> 50:12.250
As long as we can protect the Gong family.

50:14.750 --> 50:15.450
Besides,

50:16.770 --> 50:18.830
I've lost all my martial arts skills.

50:21.580 --> 50:24.380
I'm not qualified to be the Sword Wielder anymore.

50:31.540 --> 50:35.270
Yun Weishan managed to start internal conflict in the Gong family?

50:35.620 --> 50:37.020
She's capable, indeed.

50:37.970 --> 50:40.110
She made Gong Ziyu obsessed with her.

50:40.790 --> 50:43.590
No one in the Gong family can do anything about her.

50:43.770 --> 50:44.930
Although she's imprisoned in the Yu Residence

50:44.930 --> 50:47.430
under the request of the Elders,

50:49.060 --> 50:50.740
no one dares to touch her.

50:52.010 --> 50:54.610
If Gong Ziyu really becomes the Sword Wielder,

50:55.470 --> 50:56.730
the Gong family

50:57.360 --> 50:58.960
will soon face their demise.

51:03.270 --> 51:04.930
Why don't we give him a hand and

51:06.040 --> 51:07.640
accelerate it?

51:09.420 --> 51:10.090
How?

51:10.980 --> 51:12.780
Since the Gong family is caught in internal conflict now,

51:12.780 --> 51:14.110
we can gather the elite,

51:14.570 --> 51:16.650
break into the Gong Residence

51:17.470 --> 51:19.230
on the day Gong Shangjue's the weakest,

51:19.230 --> 51:20.290
and catch them all.

51:24.150 --> 51:26.680
Even if Gong Shangjue has no internal skills,

51:26.860 --> 51:27.930
it won't be easy

51:28.710 --> 51:30.570
to break into the Gong Residence.

52:06.100 --> 52:06.670
Brother.

52:07.850 --> 52:08.830
This old scar

52:10.180 --> 52:11.900
is from when you saved me

52:12.370 --> 52:13.310
back then.

52:13.540 --> 52:15.410
Gong Ziyu. Bad news.

52:15.410 --> 52:17.260
Elder found out that I went to the back hill secretly.

52:17.260 --> 52:18.900
He wanted to punish me by making me kneel in the cellar...

52:18.900 --> 52:20.560
Why are you still so reckless?

52:25.940 --> 52:28.340
Remember to knock now that Brother is back.

52:29.340 --> 52:29.800
Right.

52:30.030 --> 52:31.650
I'll knock.

52:36.630 --> 52:38.400
Brother, she's still the same.

53:06.150 --> 53:08.690
[Jue]

53:10.460 --> 53:13.190
Are you thinking about something, Young Master?

53:16.020 --> 53:17.910
We can read each other's minds.

53:18.350 --> 53:19.510
I'd like to guess

53:19.890 --> 53:21.270
what you're thinking.

53:23.140 --> 53:24.070
Take a guess.

53:29.300 --> 53:31.970
Once Gong Ziyu passes the Trial of the Three Realms,

53:31.970 --> 53:34.780
he'll be able to secure the position of Sword Wielder.

53:34.780 --> 53:36.460
You are worried, Young Master.

53:36.460 --> 53:37.050
Right?

53:47.600 --> 53:49.360
I'm surprised

53:50.770 --> 53:52.900
that he managed to get there this fast.

53:54.070 --> 53:55.370
But I'm afraid

53:57.200 --> 53:59.400
he's still a step away from that throne.

54:01.090 --> 54:02.090
What's that step?

54:18.990 --> 54:21.550
I've always wanted to give you this kite.

54:30.060 --> 54:30.750
From now on,

54:32.080 --> 54:33.540
fly high like a swan goose.

54:34.030 --> 54:35.100
From now on,

54:35.440 --> 54:36.900
fly high like a swan goose.

54:36.950 --> 54:38.110
Your fate is unique.

54:38.630 --> 54:39.810
Your fate is unique.

54:40.920 --> 54:42.240
Be at peace.

54:42.540 --> 54:43.740
Be at peace.

54:45.610 --> 54:46.450
Gong Huanyu

54:48.740 --> 54:50.140
is no longer unknown.

54:50.750 --> 54:52.750
Everyone in the world will know you.

54:53.480 --> 54:55.290
In troubled times, flowers bloom.

54:55.290 --> 54:57.220
In troubled times, flowers bloom.

55:00.980 --> 55:01.850
Wuji.

55:04.320 --> 55:05.650
Lady Wuji wrote you this

55:05.840 --> 55:08.370
when you were taking the trial, Young Master.

55:11.240 --> 55:13.320
She also made you sugar-coated haws.

55:23.550 --> 55:25.630
So where's yours?

55:27.310 --> 55:28.370
I didn't write any.

55:29.850 --> 55:32.020
But I prepared something else for you.

55:55.310 --> 55:57.040
The white feather stays still.

55:57.250 --> 55:58.980
Wind blows in every direction.

55:59.680 --> 56:00.880
Clouds float around.

56:03.130 --> 56:05.130
We met, and we'll see each other off.

56:09.920 --> 56:11.520
Do you like it, Young Master?

56:17.770 --> 56:19.700
So during the days I didn't see you,

56:20.820 --> 56:23.420
you've been working on this with Gong Zishang.

56:24.620 --> 56:25.820
I just forged a saber.

56:26.050 --> 56:27.310
I happen to need a hilt.

56:28.360 --> 56:29.620
You're so thoughtful.

56:29.830 --> 56:30.890
Of course I like it.

56:33.110 --> 56:33.890
But

56:35.570 --> 56:37.030
I don't like the last line.

56:43.130 --> 56:44.730
We finally found each other.

56:46.470 --> 56:48.070
Let's not see each other off.

56:49.200 --> 56:50.600
For the rest of our lives.

57:24.710 --> 57:26.440
You prepared a surprise for me.

57:26.700 --> 57:28.070
I'm happy.

57:28.550 --> 57:30.650
So why are you upset?

57:31.370 --> 57:32.230
You must leave.

57:34.940 --> 57:36.010
Before then,

57:36.750 --> 57:38.680
don't let Lord Sword Wielder know.

57:40.260 --> 57:40.990
Otherwise,

57:41.830 --> 57:43.200
he won't let you go.

57:43.870 --> 57:45.090
You always carry

57:45.440 --> 57:46.810
your saber with you.

57:48.200 --> 57:49.460
Now you have this hilt.

57:50.070 --> 57:51.000
It will feel like

57:51.920 --> 57:53.450
as if

57:53.870 --> 57:55.470
I'm always by your side.

57:58.870 --> 58:00.530
I also have a saber to give you.

58:01.260 --> 58:02.060
But

58:02.590 --> 58:05.190
I have to pass the test of the third realm first.

58:07.500 --> 58:08.340
You will.

58:21.350 --> 58:23.030
As long as I can hold the saber,

58:24.540 --> 58:26.000
I will always protect you.

58:28.910 --> 58:30.240
No matter what happens,

58:31.010 --> 58:32.280
you have to hold on.

58:33.830 --> 58:35.890
This is the last thing I can do for you.

58:45.410 --> 58:47.130
What if Young Master Ziyu

58:47.820 --> 58:49.860
manages to take the last step?

58:51.430 --> 58:53.430
What will you do then, Young Master?

58:54.780 --> 58:56.310
I will recognize him.

58:58.050 --> 58:59.450
And I'll hold an official

59:00.150 --> 59:02.080
Sword Wielder accession ceremony

59:02.840 --> 59:04.590
for him.

59:09.670 --> 59:10.360
Really?

59:12.040 --> 59:12.900
Are you serious

59:13.910 --> 59:15.030
about that?

59:20.780 --> 59:22.680
Can't you read my mind?

59:24.210 --> 59:25.210
What do you think?

59:27.230 --> 59:29.170
Then I need to have a talk

59:29.730 --> 59:30.790
with your heart.

59:34.420 --> 59:35.260
How?

01:00:05.910 --> 01:00:07.450
Your heart tells me

01:00:08.880 --> 01:00:11.940
you care about the Gong family very much, Young Master.

01:00:12.300 --> 01:00:13.100
So,

01:00:13.620 --> 01:00:15.530
it doesn't matter

01:00:16.330 --> 01:00:18.410
who becomes the Sword Wielder of the Gong family.

01:00:18.410 --> 01:00:19.740
But what matters is that

01:00:20.450 --> 01:00:24.710
that person has to be able to shoulder the responsibility of the Gong family.

01:00:25.830 --> 01:00:27.630
You're always against Gong Ziyu

01:00:28.790 --> 01:00:31.570
because he knows there's a spy from Wufeng beside him,

01:00:31.570 --> 01:00:34.770
but he's always covering up for her and deceiving others.

01:00:35.520 --> 01:00:38.520
He's putting the safety of the Gong family behind him.

01:00:41.060 --> 01:00:41.690
However,

01:00:42.380 --> 01:00:45.380
you couldn't do anything because you had no evidence.

01:00:53.600 --> 01:00:55.280
I will do my best

01:00:57.950 --> 01:00:59.950
to fulfill your wish, Young Master.

01:01:03.420 --> 01:01:04.380
What is this?

01:01:09.450 --> 01:01:10.850
This is the hard evidence

01:01:11.880 --> 01:01:13.350
of Yun Weishan

01:01:17.220 --> 01:01:18.350
being Wufeng's spy.

01:01:24.910 --> 01:01:26.290
She secretly took down

01:01:26.440 --> 01:01:28.670
all the secret tunnels and posts in the Gong Residence,

01:01:28.670 --> 01:01:29.650
as well as the location of the Xue, Yue, and Hua Residences

01:01:29.650 --> 01:01:31.710
in the back hill.

01:01:35.560 --> 01:01:36.480
Good job.

01:01:39.590 --> 01:01:40.890
But I'm also curious.

01:01:42.220 --> 01:01:43.690
How did you get

01:01:44.970 --> 01:01:46.300
such an important item?

01:01:48.330 --> 01:01:49.910
I found it in her room.

01:01:51.020 --> 01:01:52.130
It's getting cold.

01:01:52.580 --> 01:01:54.470
I went to borrow some clothes from her,

01:01:54.470 --> 01:01:55.430
when I found

01:01:55.830 --> 01:01:57.410
a hidden pouch

01:01:57.830 --> 01:01:59.360
sewn in a pocket of her coat.

01:02:06.570 --> 01:02:07.910
This drawing

01:02:09.910 --> 01:02:12.910
completely matches the layout of the Gong Residence.

01:02:13.880 --> 01:02:16.740
But how can we prove that it was drawn by Yun Weishan?

01:02:49.510 --> 01:02:50.460
Shangguan Qian

01:02:51.050 --> 01:02:53.910
even managed to find the weakness of Gong Shangjue.

01:02:55.270 --> 01:02:57.980
As expected from a Mei. She's much better than Yun Weishan,

01:02:57.980 --> 01:02:59.760
who got nothing done

01:02:59.930 --> 01:03:01.930
and even got her identity revealed.

01:03:01.930 --> 01:03:04.050
She's now imprisoned in the Yu Residence.

01:03:04.050 --> 01:03:06.310
She can't even deliver any message to us.

01:03:06.420 --> 01:03:08.880
She has to count on my Mei to get the antidote.

01:03:10.390 --> 01:03:12.450
Your Mei couldn't get out before either, right?

01:03:12.450 --> 01:03:13.980
What's there to be proud of?

01:03:16.860 --> 01:03:17.560
Besides,

01:03:17.900 --> 01:03:21.070
how do you know that Yun Weishan didn't reveal her identity on purpose

01:03:21.070 --> 01:03:22.730
because she had another plan?

01:03:22.850 --> 01:03:26.030
The new Sword Wielder of the Gong family has completely fallen for her.

01:03:26.030 --> 01:03:27.120
Sooner or later,

01:03:27.920 --> 01:03:29.510
the Gong family will be torn apart.

01:03:29.510 --> 01:03:31.110
Your judgment on Yun Weishan

01:03:31.170 --> 01:03:33.300
is becoming more and more irrational.

01:03:34.180 --> 01:03:34.930
I advise you

01:03:36.490 --> 01:03:37.550
not to mess with me.

01:03:46.640 --> 01:03:49.930
♫River lights, mountains dark, moon round♫

01:03:50.190 --> 01:03:53.270
♫Moonlight shines upon the mountain south♫

01:03:53.630 --> 01:03:55.100
♫My beloved♫

01:03:55.400 --> 01:03:59.320
♫Gazes at me but with a river between us♫

01:04:00.520 --> 01:04:03.880
♫The clouds and wind don't speak♫

01:04:04.110 --> 01:04:07.540
♫Love begins with a point in one's heart♫

01:04:07.980 --> 01:04:09.780
♫I have an empty room in my heart♫

01:04:09.830 --> 01:04:12.770
♫But it can't be filled by gold and silver♫

01:04:14.350 --> 01:04:20.650
♫A refuge in this world is rare♫

01:04:21.390 --> 01:04:28.510
♫How the years go by with whitening hair♫

01:04:28.840 --> 01:04:32.210
♫Listen to the shepherd boy's song♫

01:04:32.390 --> 01:04:35.730
♫Ask the flowers and leaves whom they fall for♫

01:04:32.860 --> 01:04:35.390
You can't stay in the Gong Residence anymore.

01:04:35.880 --> 01:04:41.280
♫Wish moonlight can soothe the displaced ones♫

01:04:35.900 --> 01:04:36.510
I know.

01:04:37.040 --> 01:04:38.130
I will leave.

01:04:40.380 --> 01:04:42.510
I won't make things difficult for him.

01:04:45.380 --> 01:04:45.860
Yun.

01:04:49.200 --> 01:04:55.710
♫We can't make the best of both worlds♫

01:05:03.260 --> 01:05:09.310
♫The moon is always crescent and seldom full♫

01:05:04.050 --> 01:05:06.910
I took Wufeng's order and came to the Gong Residence

01:05:06.970 --> 01:05:08.470
for freedom.

01:05:11.790 --> 01:05:13.590
I don't want to hurt people anymore.

01:05:13.590 --> 01:05:19.450
♫Gazing at the vague outline of the mountains from afar♫

01:05:20.460 --> 01:05:27.020
♫Travelers march through the woods with lanterns in hand♫

01:05:27.880 --> 01:05:31.260
♫Looking for a delicate firefly♫

01:05:31.430 --> 01:05:34.830
♫Send a red bean to the southern land♫

01:05:34.880 --> 01:05:41.220
♫Wait till life becomes warm, and I still can't let go♫

01:05:48.320 --> 01:05:54.830
♫We can't make the best of both worlds♫

01:06:02.250 --> 01:06:08.340
♫The moon is always crescent and seldom full♫
